  "summary": "2010s Soft Kawaii is an offshoot of the Kawaii aesthetic based on trends in the 2010s, especially on the website Tumblr.",
  "description": "2010s Soft Kawaii is an offshoot of the Kawaii aesthetic based on trends in the 2010s, especially on the website Tumblr. It is largely based on Japanese mascot culture, with the fashion elements being based on Himekaji and Girly Kei fashion trends of the time, as well as Korean fashion. There is also much overlap with 2014 Girly Tumblr.",
